      "solution": "$\\int 3x^2(5+x^3)^4\\,dx = \\int u^4\\frac{du}{dx}\\,dx\\quad \\left\\{u = 5+x^3 \\implies \\frac{du}{dx} = 3x^2\\right\\} = \\int u^4\\,du = \\frac{1}{5}u^5 + c = \\frac{1}{5}(5+x^3)^5 + c$",
      "ai_explanation": {
