          "The integral becomes $\\int u^4\\,du$.",
          "Evaluate to $\\frac{1}{5}u^5 + c$.",
          "Substitute back $u = 5 + x^3$."
        ],
        "common_pitfalls": "Expanding the 4th power algebraically instead of using substitution."
      }
    },
    {
